    <div type="definition">
        <!-- PREMIS Definition -->
        <p>The time period for the restriction granted.</p>
    </div>
    <div type="rationale">
        <!-- PREMIS Rationale -->
        <p>This allows repositories to express information about time-bounded restrictions like embargoes. If this is applicable, use restrictionTrigger to identify the type of start date of enforcement and restrictionDuration for the end of the time period that should be recorded.</p>
    </div>
